## I Quant To Drink Your Blood
aspect: us-comic
author: TESTING
genre: comedy-drama horror
description: A hedge fund analyst tries to survive office politics, friendship, and vampiric cravings without getting fired or staked.

PAGE preset:splash

PANEL A
loc: GERALDS_APARTMENT
chars: GERALD
shot: dramatic low angle, Gerald silhouetted against a moonlit apartment window holding a coffee mug full of dark red liquid
mood: comedic gothic horror, stylish, moody neon shadows
> Gerald stands in his tiny apartment kitchen wearing an expensive shirt with pajama bottoms.
> His eyes glow faint red in the darkness.
> A laptop nearby displays stock charts and the words "ASIA OPEN IN 20 MINUTES."
> A tiny bat hangs upside down from a coat rack in the background.
[caption bg:#140000 color:#ffcccc pos:top-left] Hedge fund analyst by day.
[caption bg:#140000 color:#ffcccc pos:top-right] Creature of the night by... also night.
[sfx pos:center color:#770000] SLURP
